<title>UK: Banco do Nordeste sets $100 mln Eurobond.</title>
<headline>Banco do Nordeste sets $100 mln Eurobond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager CS First Boston.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BANCO DO NORDESTE DO BRAZIL</p>
<p> AMT    $100 MLN	COUPON     10.0	MATURITY  * 20.DEC.04</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  99.47     PAY DATE    20.DEC.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  0.875     REOFFER    99.47     SPREAD	+383 BP</p>
